& [SupportDelta] distinguishes proven foundations from the proposed compiler assistant
  + [complete] is exact source preservation, bounded deterministic SOP parsing and lowering, signed self-hosted packages, stable semantic identity, source spans, query proof, CLI, read-only MCP, service, and live read-only Codex use
  + [formed_not_implemented] is general identity and operation catalogues, MinimalCommittedEntry transaction, CandidateSemanticIR, LLM reconciliation, general neural corpus projection, semantic diffusion, and reflex training
  + [absent] is propose_semantic_ir tool, write or commit tool, batch scanner, adjudication fixture, neural model builder, and learned artifact
  + [external_fit] current Codex MCP and SDK surfaces support proposal tools and controlled batch workflows without granting semantic authority

& [RequirementDelta] is CSAC-001 through CSAC-034
  + [identity_delta] source file, clause, semantic identity, relation, commit transaction, projection, and learned parameter are explicitly separated
  + [data_delta] CandidateSemanticIR and MinimalCommittedEntry require full SJS data-form authority
  + [tool_delta] a proposal-only MCP tool is distinct from any later write or commit tool
  + [neural_delta] exact fabric and reviewed corpus precede model construction
  + [measurement_delta] extraction correctness must be measured before training value is assumed
  + [weight_preload_delta] CSAC-027 through CSAC-034 add constrained blueprint generation, parameter-class provenance, deterministic tensor materialization, and causal initialization ablation

& [ReadinessDisposition] is full SJS before a bounded proposal fixture
  + [first_dependency] WPIO-SJS-01 reconciles stable identity and operation catalogue forms
  + [next] CSAC-SJS-01 reconciles candidate extraction, semantic commitment, faculty review, exact compilation, corpus projection, and neural artifact binding
  + [first_candidate_after_authority] is one proposal-only scan over a fixed signed corpus with two Codex runs and a deterministic parser baseline
  + [not_ready] is new MCP implementation, semantic commit, source reorganization, embedding build, neural blueprint execution, raw weight generation, model training, or llama.cpp packaging
